{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/12876","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"ND553.P5 P7 1962","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"12876","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Diurnes: découpages et photographies ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Pablo Picasso","id":"actor/picasso-pablo","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Berggruen Gallery","id":"actor/berggruen","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1962","begin_of_the_begin":"1962-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1962-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Ephemera : originally housed in box with handwriting by unknown.\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nAchevé d'imprimer le 29 janvier 1962 sur les presses de l'Imprimerie Union à Paris et dans les ateliers de Daniel Jacomet pour les phototypies et pochoirs--Colophon (p. [20]).\nCet ouvrage réalisé avec le concours de Lionel Prejger a été tiré à 1,000 exemplaires numérotés dont les cent premiers sont accompagnés d'une gravure originale de Pablo Picasso numérotée et signée par l'artiste. Cette gravure imprimée sur les presses d'Arnéra à Vallauris est présentée sous emboĩtage spécial.--Page [4].\nEach illustrated plate contained in a printed bifolium. Text and plates in a printed portolio and issued in a cloth case decorated with a color image by Picasso.\nReproductions of Picasso's collages superimposed upon Villers' photographs.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"abq copy : good condition ; dust jacket : good condition ; slipcase : good condition.|SColl abq : No. 517.|SColl abq : Originally located on 06:03. Book moved to 05:08-05 [during GOKF processing], box remained on 06:03 until GOKM processing.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}